h3. External Resources

* OXID eShop Documentation: [https://docs.oxid-esales.com|https://docs.oxid-esales.com/]
* Playwright Testing: [https://playwright.dev|https://playwright.dev/]
* Cypress Testing: [https://www.cypress.io|https://www.cypress.io/]

----

h2. Contributing

h3. Found a bug?

Please open an issue in the repository with:

* Request payload (sanitize API key!)
* Expected vs. actual response
* Module version and OXID version

h3. Feature requests?

Submit enhancement proposals via GitHub Issues.

----

h2. License

This documentation is part of the OXID Payment Component developed by OXID eSales AG.

GPL-3.0 License - See LICENSE file in repository root.

----

h2. Credits

*Documented by:* Development Team *Based on:* OXID Payment Component v4.0.0 *Organization:* OXID eSales AG *Date:* 2025-11-11

----

h2. Summary

PaymentWatch enables *secure, remote E2E testing* of payment workflows without direct database access:

✅ *IP + API Key Authentication*: Whitelist trusted test servers ✅ *Flexible Assumption Queries*: Support for operators, filters, NULL checks ✅ *RESTful JSON API*: Easy integration with Playwright, Cypress, Jest, Pytest ✅ *Database Abstraction*: No SQL knowledge required for tests ✅ *Audit Logging*: Track all assumption requests ✅ *Production-Safe*: Disabled by default, testing-only

----

*Next Steps:*

# *Activate module*: {{vendor/bin/oe-console oe:module:activate paymentwatch}}
# *Configure whitelist*: Admin → Extensions → PaymentWatch → Settings
# *Generate API key*: {{openssl rand -hex 32}}
# *Write tests*: Use examples above for Playwright/Cypress integration
# *Run E2E suite*: Verify payment flows end-to-end

----

*Happy Testing!*

